== [2] 父进程退出时,Job 句柄自动关闭 -> 孩子陪葬? ==
(a) mid 用了 KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE:
[mid] child pid=25480 in job (kill_on_close=1); mid holds on 400ms for handle pickup, then exits
mid pid=23188 grandchild pid=25480 (handle secured while mid alive)
