(b) mid 没用这面旗(对照):
[mid] child pid=1852 in job (kill_on_close=0); mid holds on 400ms for handle pickup, then exits
mid pid=5552 grandchild pid=1852 (handle secured while mid alive)
after mid exit: grandchild STILL ALIVE after 1.5s (wait TIMEOUT), hb=18 lines -> orphan lives on

== [3] 反例:孩子自己继承了 Job 句柄 -> 陪葬失灵 ==
child pid=24392 inherited ITS OWN copy of the job handle; driver closes job handle
child STILL ALIVE 1.2s after our close (its own handle keeps the job open), hb=16 lines
=> 教训:开 KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE 时,千万别让 Job 句柄被孩子继承

